1
00:00:00,382 --> 00:00:04,222
(Raj:)But, Daddy,
I-I miss my family so much,

2
00:00:04,219 --> 00:00:06,489
(Raj:)and with you and Mummy
getting a divorce,

3
00:00:06,488 --> 00:00:08,188
(Raj:)I feel sad and empty.

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,990
(Raj:)Buying a little toy

5
00:00:09,991 --> 00:00:12,661
(Raj:)every now and then
helps me fill that void.

6
00:00:12,661 --> 00:00:14,991
(Raj:)So while I can't
hug you every day,

7
00:00:14,996 --> 00:00:16,526
(Raj:)flying that helicopter...

8
00:00:16,531 --> 00:00:17,861
(Dr Koothrapalli:)I'm cutting you off.

9
00:00:17,866 --> 00:00:21,806
(Raj:)Just to be clear,
financially or mid-sentence?

10
00:00:24,572 --> 00:00:26,142
(Howard:)No red and yellow,

11
00:00:26,141 --> 00:00:27,541
(Howard:)no red and yellow.

12
00:00:28,342 --> 00:00:29,372
Yay!
It's green!

13
00:00:29,378 --> 00:00:30,978
We did it!

14
00:00:30,979 --> 00:00:32,249
Oh!

15
00:00:32,247 --> 00:00:36,747
God, if it's this much fun to
rotate, imagine when we fly it.

16
00:00:36,752 --> 00:00:39,482
(Howard:)Okay, now all I have to do
is rotate it vertically

17
00:00:39,488 --> 00:00:42,818
(Howard:)until the lights turn off.

18
00:00:42,824 --> 00:00:44,524
Oh, no!
Oh!

19
00:00:44,526 --> 00:00:47,726
(Sheldon:)All right,
playtime's over.

20
00:00:47,729 --> 00:00:49,329
(Howard:)Let's open
this baby up.

21
00:00:49,331 --> 00:00:51,701
(Sheldon:)Won't that void the warranty?

22
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:55,870
(Howard:)Sheldon, I have a master's
degree in engineering.

23
00:00:55,871 --> 00:01:00,021
(Howard:)I wipe my bottom
with warranties.

